    },
    {
      "text": "Quickly sautee the zucchini in a pan with butter over medium heat. Season with salt and pepper to taste. Cook the zucchini until slightly softened, about 2-3 minutes. Remove from the heat and set aside to cool.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cold-zucchini-salad/#wprm-recipe-53307-step-0-1",
